            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Deli Restauran & Cafe",
            "review_text": "KingsleyRoyal\nMaidenhead382 contributions\n0\nGives this a miss\nNov 2014 • Business\nI've held back from writing this review as it was our very first dining experience  in Vietnam and whilst not good I wanted to benchmark it against other restaurants during our visit.\n\nMy wife had the pumpkin soup, good choice, but rather a lot with a hint of spice.\n\nAs I was hungry I started with the Spring Rolls, unfortunately we believe that the items were not  cooked as we think we saw raw meat in the centre.\n\nI then followed this up with the chicken stir fry, very greasy and the chicken came with bone and gristle.\n\nNeedless to say the meal was unfinished.\n\nWe have completed the Vietnam leg of our tour and the food in this country outstanding, bar this one  and indeed this was the worst meal encountered during our visit\n\n Not recommended\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 26, 2014",
